        "intro_highlight": "The Royal treatment chair delivers exceptional versatility and silent electric positioning, engineered to support high-volume aesthetic clinics and multi-modality wellness centers with robust North American manufacturing standards.",
        "custom_description": "<p>Royal is purpose-built for licensed professionals, including Esthetician, Medical Spa Therapist, and Cosmetic Injector. Its fully adjustable architecture targets lower-back tension during extended treatment sessions, enabling sharper focus on treatment execution and service consistency. Whether you are performing deep-pore cleansing, brow sculpting, or post-procedure recovery, this professional station adjusts to your modality-specific positioning with friction-free adjustment and instant-response calibration.</p>",
        "subtitle": "Engineering Excellence & Ergonomic Comfort",
        "secondary_description": "<p>Durability is central to the Equipro approach. To preserve the mechanical integrity and aesthetic finish of Royal, clean surfaces regularly with disinfecting wipes formulated for clinical environments daily. The ultra-resistant leatherette resists oils, stains, and daily wear, ensuring pristine condition across intensive clinic schedules. Consistent care extends equipment longevity, protecting your investment and maintaining an immaculate presentation.</p>",
